text-base font-medium md:text-sm"><div class="mb-px mr-1 flex shrink-0 items-center "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" height="100%" class="shrink-0 h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><path fill="currentColor" d="M14.25 17.75h-4.5V18a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 4.5 0zm3.5-8.25a5.75 5.75 0 1 0-9.653 4.223c.688.637 1.346 1.496 1.571 2.527h4.664c.225-1.03.883-1.89 1.571-2.527A5.73 5.73 0 0 0 17.75 9.5m1.5 0c0 2.105-.898 4-2.33 5.324-.712.66-1.17 1.414-1.17 2.176v1a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0v-1c0-.762-.458-1.516-1.17-2.176A7.25 7.25 0 1 1 19.25 9.5"></path></svg></div><span class="min-w-0 pl-1 font-normal">Thought for 22s</span></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="prose prose-zinc prose-markdown-mobile max-w-full dark:prose-invert md:prose-markdown prose-h1:mb-2 prose-h1:text-xl prose-h1:font-medium prose-h2:text-lg prose-h2:font-medium prose-h3:text-base prose-h3:font-medium prose-pre:my-2 prose-pre:whitespace-pre-wrap prose-pre:break-words prose-pre:bg-background prose-ol:my-2 prose-ul:my-2 prose-li:my-0 PromptBox_customProse__C94Rw"><p>I'll create a stunning futuristic mobile app UI for AS Studio with glassmorphism, neon glows, and the electric blue-to-orange gradient theme you specified.</p>
<p><strong>Design Inspiration:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Modern AI SaaS platforms like Midjourney, Runway ML</li>
<li>Apple's premium design language with glass effects</li>
<li>Cyberpunk aesthetics with neon accents</li>
<li>Smooth, fluid animations and transitions</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Features for v1:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Hero section with animated tagline</li>
<li>Services showcase with interactive cards</li>
<li>Pricing packages with glass card design</li>
<li>Smooth navigation with mobile-first approach</li>
<li>Call-to-action sections</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>Design System:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Colors</strong>: Electric blue (#0066FF), vibrant orange (#FF6600), jet black gradients</li>
<li><strong>Gradients</strong>: Diagonal blueâ†’orange, radial glows</li>
<li><strong>Effects</strong>: Glassmorphism, backdrop blur, neon borders, soft shadows</li>
<li><strong>Typography</strong>: Poppins for headings (bold, futuristic), clean hierarchy</li>
<li><strong>Animations</strong>: Fade-ins, scale effects, glow pulses</li>
</ul>
<p>Let me copy the logo and build this out:</p></div></div><div class="relative flex w-full flex-col"><button class="gap-2 whitespace-nowrap focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none border border-input hover:bg-accent hover:border-accent rounded-md absolute right-0 top-0 z-10 flex h-6 items-center justify-center bg-background px-1.5 py-1 text-base font-normal transition-all duration-300 ease-out md:text-sm" aria-label="Expand tool uses">Show all</button><div class="relative overflow-hidden transition-all duration-300 ease-in-out" style="height: 24px;"><div class="flex h-full items-end"><div class="flex h-6 items-center gap-1.5 whitespace-nowrap text-base font-medium text-muted-foreground md:text-sm"><div class="mb-px flex shrink-0 items-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 -960 960 960" class="shrink-0 h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground" fill="currentColor"><path d="M560-110v-81q0-5.57 2-10.78 2-5.22 7-10.22l211.61-210.77q9.11-9.12 20.25-13.18Q812-440 823-440q12 0 23 4.5t20 13.5l37 37q9 9 13 20t4 22-4.5 22.5-13.58 20.62L692-89q-5 5-10.22 7-5.21 2-10.78 2h-81q-12.75 0-21.37-8.63Q560-97.25 560-110m300-233-37-37zM620-140h38l121-122-37-37-122 121zM220-80q-24 0-42-18t-18-42v-680q0-24 18-42t42-18h315q12.44 0 23.72 5T578-862l204 204q8 8 13 19.28t5 23.72v71q0 12.75-8.68 21.37-8.67 8.63-21.5 8.63-12.82 0-21.32-8.63-8.5-8.62-8.5-21.37v-56H550q-12.75 0-21.37-8.63Q520-617.25 520-630v-190H220v680h250q12.75 0 21.38 8.68 8.62 8.67 8.62 21.5 0 12.82-8.62 21.32Q482.75-80 470-80zm0-60v-680zm541-141-19-18 37 37z"></path></svg></div><span class="flex-shrink-0 font-normal">10 edits made</span></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="prose prose-zinc prose-markdown-mobile max-w-full dark:prose-invert md:prose-markdown prose-h1:mb-2 prose-h1:text-xl prose-h1:font-medium prose-h2:text-lg p