pre:whitespace-pre-wrap prose-pre:break-words prose-pre:bg-background prose-ol:my-2 prose-ul:my-2 prose-li:my-0 PromptBox_customProse__C94Rw"><p>Can you give me all access that I can use in startup</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-1 flex w-full justify-end"><button class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1 text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted-active hover:text-foreground focus:outline-none opacity-0 transition-colors group-hover:opacity-100" aria-label="Copy message" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" height="100%" class="shrink-0 h-4 w-4"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19.25 10c0-.69-.56-1.25-1.25-1.25h-6c-.69 0-1.25.56-1.25 1.25v8c0 .69.56 1.25 1.25 1.25h6c.69 0 1.25-.56 1.25-1.25zm-6-4c0-.69-.56-1.25-1.25-1.25H6c-.69 0-1.25.56-1.25 1.25v8c0 .69.56 1.25 1.25 1.25h3.25V10A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 12 7.25h1.25zm1.5 1.25H18A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 20.75 10v8A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 18 20.75h-6A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 9.25 18v-1.25H6A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 3.25 14V6A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 6 3.25h6A2.75 2.75 0 0 1 14.75 6z"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></div><div style="position: absolute; width: 100%; left: 0px; top: 3637.28px; visibility: visible;"><div class="group flex flex-col pb-2" data-message-id="aimsg_01k8rnbfjte00vvzxwbnj4s684" id="aimsg_01k8rnbfjte00vvzxwbnj4s684" style="min-height: auto;"><div class="relative pl-1 md:pl-0"><div class="flex flex-col space-y-4 overflow-auto px-4 text-left text-base leading-[22px]" style="overflow-wrap: anywhere;"><div class="flex flex-col text-muted-foreground"><div class="flex h-6 cursor-default items-center whitespace-nowrap text-base font-medium md:text-sm"><div class="mb-px mr-1 flex shrink-0 items-center "><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" height="100%" class="shrink-0 h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground"><path fill="currentColor" d="M14.25 17.75h-4.5V18a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 4.5 0zm3.5-8.25a5.75 5.75 0 1 0-9.653 4.223c.688.637 1.346 1.496 1.571 2.527h4.664c.225-1.03.883-1.89 1.571-2.527A5.73 5.73 0 0 0 17.75 9.5m1.5 0c0 2.105-.898 4-2.33 5.324-.712.66-1.17 1.414-1.17 2.176v1a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0v-1c0-.762-.458-1.516-1.17-2.176A7.25 7.25 0 1 1 19.25 9.5"></path></svg></div><span class="min-w-0 pl-1 font-normal">Thought for 10s</span></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="prose prose-zinc prose-markdown-mobile max-w-full dark:prose-invert md:prose-markdown prose-h1:mb-2 prose-h1:text-xl prose-h1:font-medium prose-h2:text-lg prose-h2:font-medium prose-h3:text-base prose-h3:font-medium prose-pre:my-2 prose-pre:whitespace-pre-wrap prose-pre:break-words prose-pre:bg-background prose-ol:my-2 prose-ul:my-2 prose-li:my-0 PromptBox_customProse__C94Rw"><p>I'll help you set up a complete authentication and access control system for AS Studio. First, let me clarify a few things:</p>
<p><strong>Questions:</strong></p>
<ol>
<li>
<p><strong>User Profile Data</strong>: Do you want to store additional user information like:</p>
<ul>
<li>Username/display name</li>
<li>Profile picture</li>
<li>Company/business name</li>
<li>Phone number</li>
<li>Other details?</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Access Levels</strong>: What types of user roles do you need? For example:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Admin</strong> (full access - you, Ashish Survase)</li>
<li><strong>User</strong> (regular customers who purchase services)</li>
<li><strong>Moderator</strong> (if you plan to have team members)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Authentication Methods</strong>: Which login methods do you want?</p>
<ul>
<li>Email/Password (default)</li>
<li>Google Sign-In</li>
<li>Phone/OTP</li>
<li>Others?</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<p>Once you clarify these, I'll implement:</p>
<ul>
<li>Complete login/signup system</li>
<li>User dashboard</li>
<li>Role-based access control</li>
<li>Protected routes</li>
<li>User profile management</li>
</ul>
<p>Which features are most important for your initial launch?</p></div></div><div class="mt-0 flex max-w-full flex-1 flex-col gap-4 overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="flex flex-col items-start justify-between gap-8 overflow-hidden pb-8"><div class="w-full"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-2"><button class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted-active hover:text-foreground focus:outline-none" aria-label="Helpful" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" height="100%" class="shrink-0 h-5 w-5"><path fill="currentColor" d="M13.856 3.25c1.966 0 3.181 2.146 2.17 3.832l-.7 1.168h1.243c2.653 0 4.467 2.68 3.482 5.143l-1.6 4a3.75 3.75 0 0 1-3.482 2.357H7A3.75 3.75 0 0 1 3.25 16v-4A3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7 8.25h1.639l3.24-4.05a2.53 2.53 0 0 1 1.976-.95m0 1.5c-.313 0-.61.142-.805.387L9.75 9.263v8.987h5.219c.92 0 1.747-.56 2.089-1.414l1.6-4A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 16.57 9.75H14a.75.75 0 0 1-.644-1.136l1.383-2.303a1.03 1.03 0 0 0-.884-1.561M4.75 16A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 7 18.25h1.25v-8.5H7A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 4.75 12z"></path></svg></button><button class="inline-flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-center rounded-md p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-muted-active hover:text-foreground focus:outline-none" aria-label="Not helpful" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="100%" height="100%" class="shrink-0 h-5 w-5"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19.25 8A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 17 5.75h-1.25v8.5H17A2.25 2.25 0 0 0 19.25 12zM9.03 5.75c-.92 0-1.746.56-2.088 1.414l-1.6 4a2.25 2.25 0 0 0 2.09 3.086H10a.75.75 0 0 1 .642 1.136l-1.382 2.303a1.03 1.03 0 0 0 1.688 1.174l3.302-4.128V5.75zM20.75 12A3.75 3.75 0 0 1 17 15.75h-1.64l-3.24 4.05c-.48.601-1.207.95-1.976.95-1.967 0-3.18-2.146-2.169-3.832l.7-1.168H7.431c-2.653 