zm0-60v-680zm541-141-19-18 37 37z"></path></svg></div><span class="flex-shrink-0 font-normal">2 edits made</span></div></div></div></div><div class="relative max-w-full" style="opacity: 1;"><div class="prose prose-zinc prose-markdown-mobile max-w-full dark:prose-invert md:prose-markdown prose-h1:mb-2 prose-h1:text-xl prose-h1:font-medium prose-h2:text-lg prose-h2:font-medium prose-h3:text-base prose-h3:font-medium prose-pre:my-2 prose-pre:whitespace-pre-wrap prose-pre:break-words prose-pre:bg-background prose-ol:my-2 prose-ul:my-2 prose-li:my-0 PromptBox_customProse__C94Rw"><p>Perfect! Your complete authentication system with all 3 access levels is now set up! Here's what I've implemented:</p>
<h2>âœ… <strong>Complete Access Control System</strong></h2>
<h3><strong>3 User Roles:</strong></h3>
<ul>
<li>ğŸŸ¡ <strong>Admin</strong> - Full system access (you as founder)</li>
<li>ğŸ”µ <strong>Moderator</strong> - Content moderation &amp; user support</li>
<li>ğŸŸ¢ <strong>User</strong> - Standard customer access</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>What's Included:</strong></h3>
<p><strong>ğŸ” Authentication:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Login/Signup pages with beautiful glassmorphism design</li>
<li>Email/password with input validation (zod)</li>
<li>Auto-confirm email enabled for quick testing</li>
<li>Secure session management</li>
<li>Protected routes</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>ğŸ‘¤ User Profiles:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Automatic profile creation on signup</li>
<li>Stores: name, email, company, phone, avatar</li>
<li>Role-based permissions via Row-Level Security</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>ğŸ›¡ï¸ Security Features:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Proper RLS policies on all tables</li>
<li>Security definer functions to prevent recursive policy errors</li>
<li>Input validation (prevent injection attacks)</li>
<li>Roles stored in separate table (not on profiles - prevents privilege escalation)</li>
</ul>
<p><strong>ğŸ“Š Dashboard:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Role-specific UI with badges</li>
<li>Admin, Moderator, and User sections</li>
<li>AI tools showcase</li>
<li>Profile management</li>
</ul>
<h3><strong>ğŸš€ Next Steps for You (Ashish):</strong></h3>
<ol>
<li>
<p><strong>Make yourself Admin:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Go to <strong>user_roles</strong> table</li>
<li>Find your user_id from the <strong>profiles</strong> table</li>
<li>Add a row with your user_id and role: <span class="mx-px mb-1 inline-block -translate-y-px rounded-md bg-secondary px-1.5 py-1 font-mono text-[13.5px] leading-[13.5px]">admin</span></li>
</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Configure Auth URLs:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>In Backend â†’ Authentication â†’ URL Configuration</li>
