</ul>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Test the system:</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>Visit <span class="mx-px mb-1 inline-block -translate-y-px rounded-md bg-secondary px-1.5 py-1 font-mono text-[13.5px] leading-[13.5px]">/auth</span> to create an account</li>
<li>Check your dashboard at <span class="mx-px mb-1 inline-block -translate-y-px rounded-md bg-secondary px-1.5 py-1 font-mono text-[13.5px] leading-[13.5px]">/dashboard</span></li>
<li>Assign roles to other users as admin</li>
</ul>
</li>
