k-500 p-0.5 mb-4 group-hover:shadow-lg group-hover:shadow-current transition-shadow"><div class="w-full h-full bg-card rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe w-8 h-8 text-white"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></div></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-foreground group-hover:text-gradient transition-colors">Website Design</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Build responsive, modern websites that convert visitors into customers.</p><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/0 via-primary/10 to-secondary/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm glass-card p-6 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer group border-0 animate-fade-in" style="animation-delay: 300ms;"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-green-500 to-emerald-500 p-0.5 mb-4 group-hover:shadow-lg group-hover:shadow-current transition-shadow"><div class="w-full h-full bg-card rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-trending-up w-8 h-8 text-white"><polyline points="22 7 13.5 15.5 8.5 10.5 2 17"></polyline><polyline points="16 7 22 7 22 13"></polyline></svg></div></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-foreground group-hover:text-gradient transition-colors">Social Media Branding</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Complete social media setup with branded content and growth strategies.</p><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/0 via-primary/10 to-secondary/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm glass-card p-6 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer group border-0 animate-fade-in" style="animation-delay: 400ms;"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-yellow-500 to-orange-500 p-0.5 mb-4 group-hover:shadow-lg group-hover:shadow-current transition-shadow"><div class="w-full h-full bg-card rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-sparkles w-8 h-8 text-white"><path d="M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z"></path><path d="M20 3v4"></path><path d="M22 5h-4"></path><path d="M4 17v2"></path><path d="M5 18H3"></path></svg></div></div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2 text-foreground group-hover:text-gradient transition-colors">Brand Kit Creation</h3><p class="text-muted-foreground text-sm leading-relaxed">Get a complete brand identity package including colors, fonts, and guidelines.</p><div class="absolute inset-0 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-primary/0 via-primary/10 to-secondary/0 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity pointer-events-none"></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm glass-card p-6 hover:scale-105 transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer group border-0 animate-fade-in" style="animation-delay: 500ms;"><div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500 to-blue-5